{"ref":"BDB, אַוָּה","hw":"אַוָּה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אַוָּה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. desire</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַוַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.15\">Dt 12:15</a> + 5 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַוָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:10\" href=\"/Hosea.10.10\">Ho 10:10</a>—<em>desire, will</em>, usually sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ</span>; of natural human desire (morally indiff.), for meat <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.15\">Dt 12:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.21\">21</a>; of longing for sanctuary <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.6\">18:6</a>; of royal good pleasure <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.20\">1 S 23:20</a>; without <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶשׁ</span>, of wild-ass <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.24\">Je 2:24</a>; of divine will <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:10\" href=\"/Hosea.10.10\">Ho 10:10</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱוִי","prev":"BDB, אַו"}